{"type":"text","timestamp":1794388364099,"sessionID":"ses_e362cbcc5ffetEet2s6HUfeign","part":{"id":"prt_1c9e18b2c0018ib0m7kS6PJYqY","messageID":"msg_1c9e0d70a0014jEgtRkJUS2GV3","sessionID":"ses_e362cbcc5ffetEet2s6HUfeign","type":"text","text":"The hash mismatch is a local pip 25.x quirk with constraint-file hashes (not my code). The base `python:3.13-slim` image's pip honors the existing lock file — and I don't need to change any backend dependencies (flask + gunicorn + stdlib are enough). Let me install Flask locally without the constraints file just to test the app:\n\n","time":{"start":1794388364076,"end":1794388364095}}}
